(Collaborative peer sessions synchronize sample clocks using round-trip timestamp exchanges:) Tj
T* (    Round-Trip Time: RTT = \(t4 - t1\) - \(t3 - t2\)) Tj
T* (    Clock Offset   : theta = [\(t2 - t1\) + \(t3 - t4\)] / 2) Tj
T* (    Scheduled Epoch: T_start = t_current + delta t_margin  \(delta t_margin >= max\(RTT\) + 50ms\)) Tj
T* (This locks all peer DAC playback timelines to an identical hardware epoch, eliminating audio drift across distributed workstations without audio) Tj
T* (re-sampling or loss of fidelity.) Tj
